flowchart TD
    A([Start sale]) --> B[/Search or select product/]
    B --> C{Stock available?}
    C -- No --> D[/Show out-of-stock alert/]
    D --> B
    C -- Yes --> E[Add or increment cart item]
    E --> F[/Enter discount and press Charge/]
    F --> G{Cart empty?}
    G -- Yes --> H[/Show empty-sale alert/]
    H --> B
    G -- No --> I[/Enter cash amount/]
    I --> J{All items still in stock?}
    J -- No --> K[/Show stock error and keep cart/]
    K --> B
    J -- Yes --> L{Paid amount covers total?}
    L -- No --> M[/Show insufficient-payment alert/]
    M --> I
    L -- Yes --> N[Create invoice and sale record]
    N --> O[Reduce each product stock]
    O --> P[(Save sales and products in localStorage)]
    P --> Q[/Show and print receipt/]
    Q --> R([Sale complete])
